{"lines":[{"y":0.073957598140749092,"w":0.11286211649576822,"c":1,"x":0.14469676117976304,"h":0.016328989730216015,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"t":"TEST 3","x":0.44546544772007401,"w":0.097790908813476629,"y":0.12056143967286292,"h":0.017598050836586498,"c":1},{"h":0.016099747426265743,"y":0.18448164818325252,"t":"SECTION 1","c":1,"x":0.14473684468825876,"w":0.14473683675130206},{"w":0.045112781524658196,"h":0.011627907148116789,"t":"LINDA:","x":0.14285714293441276,"c":1,"y":0.21511627894532148},{"t":"MATT:","c":1,"y":0.23110465119046442,"w":0.03947368303934734,"h":0.010174418447559619,"x":0.14473684260626618},{"x":0.22180450959083653,"w":0.16917293548583984,"h":0.014605077558076496,"c":1,"t":"Hello, Linda speaking.","y":0.21366279088817097},{"y":0.22566462848238289,"h":0.02016578792220769,"w":0.61860529581705737,"c":1,"x":0.22171566081018418,"t":"Oh hi, Linda. This is Matt Brooks. Alex White gave me your number. He said you'd"},{"c":1,"x":0.22180450934925622,"y":0.24404378617028555,"h":0.017707662588538398,"w":0.43233083089192703,"t":"be able to give me some advice about moving to Banford."},{"h":0.0087209303610876754,"x":0.14473684181111435,"c":1,"t":"LINDA:","y":0.26308139526380836,"w":0.043233083089192714},{"x":0.1447368425968677,"w":0.03947368303934734,"c":1,"h":0.0087209303610875644,"t":"MATT:","y":0.27906976735683164},{"t":"LINDA:","x":0.14471064597593727,"y":0.29498006527369147,"h":0.0088770787177051558,"c":1,"w":0.043285474777221666},{"x":0.22180451472219553,"y":0.26014166118181214,"t":"Yes, Alex did mention you. How can I help?","w":0.3251879628499349,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1},{"y":0.27616279089279627,"x":0.22180450659634593,"c":1,"t":"Well, first of all - which area to live in?","w":0.28759399414062498,"h":0.014564832870375244},{"c":1,"x":0.22180451692119693,"y":0.29069767411565661,"t":"Well, I live in Dalton, which is a really nice suburb - not too expensive, and there's Example","w":0.697368418375651,"h":0.017441860722175129},{"w":0.092211786905924492,"t":"a nice park.","h":0.0135361891904342,"c":1,"x":0.21987155060941091,"y":0.30791213785166871},{"w":0.043233083089192714,"t":"MATT:","y":0.32412790699753113,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"x":0.14097744332904608},{"c":1,"h":0.016097875080489432,"x":0.21992482174312614,"y":0.32260141649360108,"t":"Sounds good. Do you know how much it would be to rent a two bedroom","w":0.54511276245117191},{"t":"flat there?","y":0.33783096310503247,"w":0.079381599426269545,"h":0.014745050296427253,"x":0.21970769709578974,"c":1},{"y":0.35719481410045306,"c":1,"x":0.14461329766935704,"w":0.041600472132364924,"t":"LINDA:","h":0.0094475810633730672},{"t":"Yeah, you should be able to get something reasonable for 850 pounds per month.","y":0.35405195739236717,"c":1,"x":0.21984637034598906,"w":0.61105489095052079,"h":0.017932636386259637},{"y":0.35610465116540913,"h":0.013081395234588733,"w":0.024436090787251841,"c":1,"x":0.84962405978337907,"t":"Q1"},{"w":0.61278193155924487,"x":0.22180452271689471,"y":0.37057308444695458,"t":"That's what people typically pay. You certainly wouldn't want to pay more than 900","h":0.016097875080489432,"c":1},{"t":"pounds. That doesn't include bills or anything","w":0.34022557576497398,"x":0.21992480599029979,"y":0.38662790716886453,"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1},{"t":"MATT:","x":0.14097744331393153,"y":0.40406976732557442,"h":0.011627907148116678,"w":0.043233083089192714,"c":1},{"h":0.017483606848191724,"t":"No. That sounds alright. I'Il definitely have a look there. Are the transport links easy","w":0.62042714436848967,"y":0.40115685839718962,"c":1,"x":0.2198576879167618},{"c":1,"w":0.15829055786132812,"y":0.41705941727693541,"t":"from where you live?","x":0.21975791479579243,"h":0.017054386470522043},{"h":0.011183202612116028,"y":0.43554211960087619,"c":1,"x":0.14080268331488402,"t":"LINDA:","w":0.047342001597086597},{"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1,"y":0.43303283956527694,"t":"Well, I'm very lucky. I work in the city centre so I don't have to use public transport.","x":0.2199248115229481,"w":0.61654134114583337},{"c":1,"y":0.45010881507157086,"x":0.2198138936691765,"t":"1 go by bike","h":0.014026555873775104,"w":0.090447400410970019},{"t":"MATT:","x":0.14097744291302183,"y":0.46802325586827442,"c":1,"h":0.010174418447559619,"w":0.041353384653727204},{"c":1,"t":"LINDA:","x":0.14094884925353923,"y":0.48249166151116041,"w":0.045169970194498699,"h":0.011760862734881194},{"w":0.44568328857421868,"h":0.016704997783005049,"t":"Oh, I wish I could do that. Is it safe to cycle around the city?","c":1,"y":0.46380040848459625,"x":0.21982319366951306},{"c":1,"h":0.016097875080489432,"t":"Yes, it's fine. And it keeps me fit. Anyway, driving to work in the city centre would","y":0.48100450710259857,"x":0.21992482034916122,"w":0.59774434407552079},{"c":1,"t":"be a nightmare because there's hardly any parking. And the traffic during the rush","w":0.61090225219726568,"h":0.016107234353030409,"y":0.49709302298070313,"x":0.21992481360691063},{"t":"Q3","x":0.84774436069572878,"w":0.028195489247639927,"y":0.49709302318212423,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"h":0.014606949903852917,"t":"hour can be bad.","c":1,"y":0.51308139553776066,"x":0.21804511569672499,"w":0.13157894134521483},{"x":0.14097744409540569,"c":1,"w":0.03947368303934734,"t":"MATT:","y":0.53052325569596748,"h":0.011627907148116789},{"t":"LINDA:","y":0.54651162796340413,"w":0.045112781524658224,"x":0.1409774437342384,"h":0.010174418447559619,"c":1},{"x":0.2180451067603702,"y":0.52897617491405469,"w":0.59022557576497392,"h":0.014628476046471994,"c":1,"t":"I'd be working from home but I'd have to go to London one or two days a week."},{"w":0.57347834269205733,"h":0.017823105693554275,"t":"Oh, that's perfect. Getting to London is no problem. There's a fast train every","y":0.54326654189636903,"x":0.21984537156112974,"c":1},{"x":0.219924819671279,"y":0.55956213798354448,"w":0.30639096577962244,"t":"30 minutes which only takes 45 minutes.","h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1},{"t":"MATT:","x":0.14097744409592786,"h":0.010174418447559508,"w":0.039473683039347313,"y":0.57848837214613302,"c":1},{"y":0.59267828473245132,"h":0.012317849065285658,"c":1,"t":"LINDA:","x":0.14083225320949647,"w":0.045403162638346345},{"y":0.57542210179195785,"w":0.090904820760091126,"h":0.016304967331256859,"t":"That's good","c":1,"x":0.21955042188714355},{"y":0.59015864728025857,"c":1,"t":"Yeah, the train service isn't bad during the week. And they run quite late at night","h":0.018055594665959629,"w":0.59791198730468753,"x":0.21983424048768521},{"t":"It's weekends that are a problem. They're always doing engineering work and you","h":0.018197793463162304,"w":0.61108479817708328,"x":0.21795281947334161,"y":0.60586110603741983,"c":1},{"y":0.62354651135403727,"x":0.21804511880380839,"w":0.61654134114583337,"c":1,"h":0.015988372635703185,"t":"have to take a bus to Hadham and pick up the train there, which is really slow. But"},{"t":"other than that, Banford's a great place to live. I've never been happier.","x":0.2180451136501472,"w":0.53383458455403643,"h":0.01481004507405026,"y":0.63940759817980264,"c":1},{"h":0.010923954263012847,"w":0.045386727650960301,"t":"LINDA:","y":0.68131127866196839,"x":0.14084047066232097,"c":1},{"x":0.14064604788044061,"w":0.040136467615763338,"c":1,"y":0.71265726024650444,"t":"MATT:","h":0.010731991229330551},{"t":"LINDA:","x":0.14088647868821713,"h":0.012037546190997506,"y":0.72799285478709441,"w":0.043415012359619143,"c":1},{"x":0.13909774366490149,"c":1,"h":0.010174418447559619,"t":"MATT:","y":0.80813953493804191,"w":0.041353384653727232},{"w":0.043271910349527987,"t":"LINDA:","y":0.8240701749004633,"h":0.0088363943450003868,"c":1,"x":0.14095802969801824},{"h":0.0087209303610876754,"c":1,"x":0.14097744409592786,"t":"MATT:","y":0.84011627898370034,"w":0.039473683039347313},{"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"y":0.85465116267973329,"t":"LINDA:","x":0.13909774448611811,"w":0.045112781524658196},{"c":1,"x":0.13909774365893421,"h":0.011627907148116789,"y":0.87063953476573497,"w":0.041353384653727232,"t":"MATT:"},{"w":0.043233083089192686,"c":1,"x":0.1409774433238247,"h":0.0087209303610875644,"y":0.90261627898473873,"t":"LINDA:"},{"y":0.91860465121711177,"h":0.010174418447559619,"t":"MATT:","x":0.13909774366490149,"w":0.041353384653727232,"c":1},{"y":0.9345930231717291,"c":1,"h":0.0087209303610875644,"t":"LINDA:","w":0.043233083089192714,"x":0.14097744332809675},{"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"t":"MATT:","x":0.13909774488289434,"y":0.94912790674570902,"w":0.041353381474812823},{"y":0.96802325583260307,"h":0.013081395234588733,"x":0.14097744328797229,"t":"108","w":0.035714286168416348,"c":1},{"h":0.015300323329122234,"x":0.21799504472092943,"y":0.67875174539495897,"c":1,"w":0.61287923177083337,"t":"There are some nice restaurants in the city centre and a brand new cinema which"},{"t":"Q6","x":0.84774436110292695,"y":0.67877906969375201,"w":0.026315789222717267,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"y":0.69476744204848595,"w":0.53759399414062503,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.21804510807883085,"t":"has only been open a couple of months. There's a good arts centre too.","c":1},{"y":0.71075581414741706,"w":0.23308270772298176,"t":"Sounds like Banford's got it all.","c":1,"x":0.21992481145572781,"h":0.014614436830617583},{"x":0.21804510675883951,"t":"Yes! We're really lucky. There are lots of really good aspects to living here. The","w":0.59022557576497403,"y":0.72665808105951801,"h":0.01462098850562199,"c":1},{"x":0.21804512991262318,"y":0.7411461684030366,"t":"schools are good and the hospital here is one of the best in the country. Everyone I Q7","w":0.65601501464843759,"h":0.016121272954799593,"c":1},{"h":0.01462098850562199,"w":0.62406016031901035,"c":1,"y":0.75872093043029065,"t":"know who's been there's had a positive experience. Oh, I can give you the name of","x":0.21804510771643465},{"t":"my dentist too in Bridge Street, if you're interested. I've been going to him for years Q8","w":0.65601501464843748,"y":0.77462974901378334,"c":1,"x":0.21804512416496455,"h":0.014614436830617694},{"x":0.21975006757668059,"y":0.78757771715219249,"w":0.25228993733723959,"h":0.016291120324070429,"c":1,"t":"and I've never had any problems."},{"y":0.80380923516821889,"h":0.016440840436808934,"x":0.21780041108234272,"w":0.13020165761311847,"t":"Oh, OK. Thanks!","c":1},{"x":0.21791217154403766,"y":0.81979042086248988,"w":0.28221832275390624,"h":0.016182740427030717,"t":"IIl find his number and send it to you.","c":1},{"t":"Thanks, that would be really helpful.","y":0.83708950432310381,"h":0.014810045074050149,"c":1,"x":0.21804510762016163,"w":0.27067670186360682},{"w":0.29511278788248702,"t":"Are you planning to visit Banford soon?","y":0.8531873794755237,"h":0.014545178459447583,"c":1,"x":0.21804510972417007},{"c":1,"x":0.21795887729362259,"h":0.017377597934111311,"w":0.53023386637369785,"y":0.86739772850193164,"t":"Yes. My wife and I are both coming next week. We want to make some"},{"x":0.21791972842021598,"h":0.016098445565640662,"w":0.24462275187174479,"t":"appointments with estate agents","c":1,"y":0.88394278867294174},{"c":1,"y":0.89954925963469601,"x":0.21804511054056178,"h":0.014810045074050149,"t":"I could meet you if you like and show you around.","w":0.37218045552571621},{"h":0.014585423147148724,"c":1,"y":0.91564713478127069,"x":0.21804511722664774,"t":"Are you sure? We'd really appreciate that.","w":0.31578946431477861},{"c":1,"t":"Either a Tuesday or Thursday is good for me, after 5.30.","w":0.41917292277018225,"h":0.014547050805223893,"y":0.93168604670824429,"x":0.21804511746743402},{"w":0.026315789222717267,"t":"Q9","y":0.93168604651424636,"x":0.84774436093375416,"c":1,"h":0.013081395234588733},{"h":0.01481004507405026,"x":0.2180451038859629,"t":"Thursday's preferable - Tuesday I need to get home before 6 pm.","y":0.94752092697754275,"w":0.48872182210286463,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3106}